		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλαζ-άεις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like hail,</i>
